// The Dual key: toggles the off hand between the dual copy and the free hand.
// Toggling back to the free hand is how you do a hands-on VR reload of the
// main gun while dual wielding, so it is bound rather than buried in a menu.
AddKeySection "Aliens VR Weapons" AEVRWeapons
AddMenuKey "Dual wield on/off" ae_dualkey
alias ae_dualkey "netevent ae_dual"

// 2026-10-22 (owner: "need a keybind for dual like BD22"): bound out of the box to the off
// controller's X button (free in QuestZDoom's default layout: A use, Y jump, B free, X free).
// Rebind under Customize Controls -> Aliens VR Weapons.
defaultbind Pad_X ae_dualkey
